  "limitations": [
    "Potential contribution of non-visual effects from daylight on outcome variables could not be completely controlled or separated from view effects.",
    "Study assessed window effects only in a slightly warm condition (28 \u00b0C), limiting generalizability to other thermal conditions.",
    "Window view consisted mostly of trees and sunny sky; different view contents (e.g., buildings, overcast sky) or luminance patterns might yield different effects.",
    "Short-term exposure (55 min) in a lab setting, limiting generalizability to prolonged effects in real-world office environments.",
    "Small effect sizes (r ranging from 0.29 to 0.36) based on Ferguson's thresholds, which may raise concerns about practical utility, though authors argue thresholds are controversial and effects are meaningful for multiple aspects."
  ],
